msgstr ""
"Hat einen Fokusmotor; libcamera steuert ihn während einer Vorschau an."

#. settings-schema.json->allow-lens-cameras->description
msgid "Allow preview of cameras with a focus motor"
msgstr "Vorschau für Kameras mit Fokusmotor erlauben"

#. settings-schema.json->allow-lens-cameras->tooltip
msgid ""
"While such a camera streams, libcamera drives its focus motor automatically."
" Leave this off if the focus motor does not work properly."
